<div class="prose page-pad">
  <h1>About Cartward</h1>
  <p>Cartward is a small demonstration shop built to show a complete, working storefront —
  browsing, carts, checkout, orders, and an operator's admin panel — end to end.</p>
  <p>Every product, brand and customer in this shop is fictional. Payments run through a sandbox
  processor only: no card is ever charged, because there are no real cards anywhere in the system.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>In a real shop this is where you'd find us. Here, the contact form would land in the same
  captured-mailbox every other email does.</p>
</div>
